    Bug 2021632 - Implement control for custom accent colors in the Appearance setting. r=arschmitz,rtaylor


    Implement a simple color selection with a limited list of defined colors.
    Let the selected color replace the primary color used in the application.
    The color is ignored if the system is in HC mode and a disclaimer message
    is showed below that preference.
    Currently ignoring lightweight themes and sidebar custom colors as I'm planning
    to tackle that in a follow up.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D286507

